        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Naschitti%2C_New_Mexico",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Early settlers dug a well from the badger’s discovery, providing drinking water for years.",
